        "title": "Calculate the Second Bracket",
        "text": "For $a^2 + ab + b^2$ with $a = 2x$ and $b = 3$:\n\n- $a^2 = (2x)^2 = 4x^2$\n- $ab = (2x)(3) = 6x$\n- $b^2 = 3^2 = 9$\n\nSo: $a^2 + ab + b^2 = 4x^2 + 6x + 9$",
        "variabilization": {},
