        "text": "For **difference** of cubes ($a^3 - b^3$):\n\n$(a - b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)$ - SOAP: **S**ame sign, **O**pposite sign, **A**lways **P**ositive\n\nThe first bracket has the SAME sign as the original.\nThe middle term has the OPPOSITE sign.\nThe last term is ALWAYS POSITIVE.",
